---
---
<section class="about-section section-padding" id="about">
  <div class="container about-grid">

    <!-- Left: Editorial Story Copy -->
    <div class="about-copy">
      <span class="about-kicker" data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 0">Our Story</span>
      <h2 class="about-title" data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 1">
        Built for the journey<br />you're <em>already on.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="about-lead" data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 2">
        Lakingz Services was founded in 2018 by Oluwakemi Olobade — a Chartered Accountant who saw firsthand how Canada's tax system creates unnecessary barriers for newcomers who simply haven't had time to learn it yet.
      </p>
      <p class="about-body" data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 3">
        What began as a part-time practice in Brampton has grown into a year-round accounting firm serving over 100 active clients across Ontario. Nearly all of our growth comes through referrals — clients recommending us to family members, friends, and colleagues who need the same clarity they found here.
      </p>
      <p class="about-body" data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 4">
        We started by serving Black immigrant families and small business owners, and have since expanded to support newcomers from across the world — Asian, Filipino, and many other communities — all navigating the same unfamiliar system, all deserving the same quality of support.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Company Fact Sheet Card -->
    <div class="about-datacard" data-reveal="right" style="--reveal-index: 2">

      <div class="datacard-entry">
        <span class="dc-index">01</span>
        <div class="dc-body">
          <span class="dc-value">Est. 2018</span>
          <span class="dc-label">Founded in Brampton, Ontario — grown from a one-person practice to a year-round firm</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dc-divider"></div>

      <div class="datacard-entry">
        <span class="dc-index">02</span>
        <div class="dc-body">
          <span class="dc-value">100+</span>
          <span class="dc-label">Active clients across Ontario, with most new clients arriving through word-of-mouth referrals</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dc-divider"></div>

      <div class="datacard-entry">
        <span class="dc-index">03</span>
        <div class="dc-body">
          <span class="dc-value">98.2%</span>
          <span class="dc-label">Client retention — our relationships don't end after tax season</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dc-divider"></div>

      <div class="datacard-entry">
        <span class="dc-index">04</span>
        <div class="dc-body">
          <span class="dc-value">Multi-community</span>
          <span class="dc-label">Serving Black, Asian, Filipino, and diverse newcomer communities across the GTA and Ontario</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    background-color: var(--bg-surface);
    border-top: var(--sheet-border);
    border-bottom: var(--sheet-border);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* ── Left Copy ─────────────────────────── */
  .about-kicker {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--accent-mint);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: var(--fs-2xl);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent-mint);
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .about-body {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  /* ── Right Data Card ──────────────────── */
  .about-datacard {
    background-color: var(--bg-canvas);
    border: var(--sheet-border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .datacard-entry {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
  }

  .dc-index {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent-mint);
    padding-top: 7px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-width: 20px;
  }

  .dc-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .dc-value {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .dc-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .dc-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: oklch(90% 0.006 150);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ───────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .about-lead,
    .about-body {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
